WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.750
﻿The day has come at last.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:13.520
﻿It's time to end to this!

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.150
﻿I've undergone gifted
﻿education in the arts,

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.460
﻿and have won prizes
﻿at many exhibitions.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.830
﻿The only person better
﻿than me, Caroline Yajima...

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.060
﻿She always stands in my way.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:26.200
﻿But this year...

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:31.440
﻿I'm going to get my revenge,
﻿China Kousaka!

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.110
﻿Hey, Caro. Long time no see.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.540
﻿It's Caroline, not Caro!

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.310
﻿Caroline Yajima!

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.550
﻿Don't address me like
﻿some candy mascot!

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.780
But you're still Caro to me.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.250
﻿Like I said...!

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.490
﻿No, no.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.620
﻿She's just trying to upset me
﻿for the sake of psychological warfare.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.690
﻿It's not going to be that easy.

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:58.160
﻿I'm not only trained in the arts,
﻿but also in mental disciplines.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.400
﻿Yes, everything I do...
﻿is to win against you!

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.570
﻿Aren't you checking the results?

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.240
﻿Of course I'm going to!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.140
﻿Miss Caroline.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.580
﻿Congratulations on your gold prize.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:16.750
﻿The contours are crisp,
﻿and the image is well simplified.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.520
﻿The value contrast is strong...

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.290
﻿You fully explored the charm
﻿of watercolor painting.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.660
﻿It's an excellent piece.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:26.760
﻿Congrats.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:31.360
﻿I guess I should
﻿thank you for saying that.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:35.070
﻿By the way,
﻿what kind of work did you present?

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.340
﻿Some landscape, like always?

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.070
﻿Not this time.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.980
﻿G-Grand prize!?

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.550
﻿It's better than your prize, Miss.

00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:51.280
﻿The most valuable...!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.590
﻿That's just like my lifelong rival.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.890
﻿But what is this!?

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.360
﻿What on earth is this?
﻿A bear? A robot!?

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:01.790
﻿It's not a robot, but a Gunpla.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.130
﻿A what?

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:08.470
﻿Gunpla means a plastic model
﻿from the anime "Mobile Suit Gundam".

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.200
﻿A plastic model...

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.010
﻿I lost to a piece that's about a toy?

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.310
﻿Sh-She's making fun of me.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:20.980
﻿China Kousaka...

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:24.880
﻿I won't forget this humiliation!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.590
﻿Welcome.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:08.500
﻿Are you ready to order?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.270
﻿T-Two rice omelets, please.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.740
﻿C-Certainly, sir.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:21.180
﻿Dad, two rice omelets.

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:23.450
﻿Hey, China.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.920
﻿Can't you be a little friendlier
﻿to our customers?

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.320
﻿L-Like this?

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.760
﻿My bad...

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.030
﻿Just be yourself.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.960
﻿China, you have a phone call
﻿from Iori's mother.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.600
﻿Hello, it's China.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:46.070
<i>﻿China, help me.</i>

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.940
<i>﻿What's the matter?</i>

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.610
﻿These last few days,

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:53.180
﻿Sei hasn't come out of our workshop.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.780
﻿Except for eating and sleeping,
﻿he's always working on his Gunpla.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.350
﻿I tell him to rest,
﻿but he won't listen.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:03.990
﻿But he might listen to what you say.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:07.690
<i>﻿I mean, you are
﻿his precious girlfriend.</i>

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.570
﻿Okay.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.330
﻿I'll be right there!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.610
﻿Thanks for the meal, Kousaka.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:29.580
﻿Iori, you're working too hard.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.450
﻿I know.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.720
﻿But I have less than two weeks
﻿until the World Tournament.

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:37.420
﻿But...

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.390
﻿Your Gunpla is almost done.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.130
﻿Yeah.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.730
﻿I think I gave it everything I have.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.730
﻿But I wonder if this Gunpla...

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:52.040
﻿can fight on a par with
﻿the world's greatest fighters.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:56.940
﻿I can't help but think
﻿there's more I can do.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:02.680
﻿I know I have to finish it soon
﻿so Reiji can practice, but...

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.420
﻿Where is he?

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.180
﻿I haven't seen him for a few days.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.750
﻿Nothing unusual about that.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.920
﻿Hey, Iori.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.060
﻿Huh?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.990
﻿I finished my new Gunpla.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.530
﻿Would you take a look at it?

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:21.230
﻿Really!? I will, I will! Show me!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.900
﻿It's not as nicely built as yours.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:25.970
﻿That doesn't matter!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.540
﻿I'll go get it, then.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:29.710
﻿- Meet me at the park?
﻿- Okay.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.710
﻿Nice job, China.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.520
﻿A Beargguy painted
﻿in your original colors, huh?

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:44.020
﻿You sure belong to the art club.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.790
﻿It's painted really nicely.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:47.760
﻿You think?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.590
﻿Yeah!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.430
﻿You'd never think that
﻿a Gunpla beginner built it.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.530
﻿Huh?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:56.530
﻿What is it?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.670
﻿Kousaka, this Beargguy...

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:08.310
﻿Haven't seen you since
﻿the exhibition, Miss China.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.350
﻿Do you know her?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:13.950
﻿I see her often at art exhibitions.
﻿Her name is Caro.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.720
﻿Don't call me by that name!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.690
﻿I'm not Caro, I'm Caroline!

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:21.390
﻿Caroline Yajima!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.330
﻿Oh no.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.230
﻿I almost got caught up
﻿in your game again.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.830
﻿By the way,

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:31.770
﻿I did some research on you, Miss China.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:35.410
﻿You got a boyfriend recently, huh?

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:39.940
﻿What? I'm not her boyfriend.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:40.940
﻿Right?

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.380
﻿Um...

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:46.250
﻿Oh, how charmingly naive.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.520
﻿But that's not my point!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:53.160
﻿You've been building Gunpla
﻿because of his influence, right?

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:54.890
Yeah.

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.360
﻿This is the Gunpla that I built,

00:07:58.530 --> 00:07:59.900
﻿Mr. Beargguy III.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.230
﻿How cute!

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.270
﻿Right?

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.570
﻿Look. Its mouth moves.

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:07.870
﻿Cute!

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:10.010
﻿Right?

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.910
﻿"Hello, Caro."

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.010
﻿"I'm Beargguy."

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.880
﻿Hello!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:17.180
﻿I'm Caro!

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:19.580
﻿Stop it!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.450
﻿Why am I putting on
﻿a puppet show with a Gunpla!?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.720
﻿But, Miss Caro...

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.560
﻿It's Caroline!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.090
﻿S-Sorry...

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.390
﻿I thought you came to see Kousaka?

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:35.570
﻿Oops. For a person of my status,
﻿I lost control a little bit.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:38.540
﻿- Miss China Kousaka.
- ﻿Yes?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:42.040
﻿I came to tell you about... this!

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:46.210
"﻿In commemoration of the
﻿Gunpla Battle World Tournament"?

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.880
"﻿Girls-Only Gunpla Battle...
﻿Now recruiting contestants"?

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:51.620
﻿Yes!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.020
﻿I lost to you at the last exhibition.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:57.860
﻿But I'll beat you this time!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:02.460
﻿Let's see whose Gunpla is
the most beautiful and the strongest!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:04.600
﻿W-Wait a minute.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.930
﻿I didn't build Mr. Beargguy III
﻿to play Gunpla Battle.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:10.400
﻿Are you chickening out?

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.370
﻿No, I'm just...

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:14.200
﻿These last few days,

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:16.640
﻿Sei hasn't come out of our workshop.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.610
﻿Except for eating and sleeping,
﻿he's always working on his Gunpla.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:23.580
﻿Okay. I'll enter.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:24.750
﻿Kousaka?

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:27.250
﻿So you'll accept my challenge?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.650
Yes.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:31.420
﻿Thank you, Miss China.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:35.530
﻿I'll be waiting for you
﻿at the arena next Sunday.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.800
﻿Are you sure, Kousaka?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.230
﻿Yes, I made up my mind.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:46.400
﻿Iori, I've never played Gunpla Battle.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.770
﻿Will you teach me?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.170
﻿Okay.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:52.140
﻿Sure, I can teach you
﻿stuff about Gunpla,

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:54.340
﻿but as for controlling it...

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.180
﻿I'll teach her.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.620
﻿Reiji!

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.420
﻿I heard what you were talking about.

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.520
﻿If you're challenged by
﻿some awful stuck-up girl,

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.420
﻿you'll just have to win!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.090
﻿Yes, I intend to.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.860
﻿Okay! Let's go to the store!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.060
﻿Yeah!

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.060
﻿President Yajima.

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:19.100
﻿Thank you for being my personal
﻿sponsor for the World Tournament.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:20.860
﻿You're welcome.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:25.200
﻿It's an honor to be able to
﻿support you, the Early Genius,

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.070
﻿Nils Nielsen.

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.210
﻿Dad!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.110
﻿Caroline? Why are you...?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:35.750
﻿I have a favor to ask of you,
﻿the American champion.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.880
Um, I...

00:11:37.980 --> 00:11:40.820
﻿I'll explain the details
﻿at my mansion.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:43.590
﻿There's no time to waste!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.220
﻿W-Wait. What...?

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.760
﻿What’s going on, Mr. President!?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.600
﻿No! It's not like that!

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:57.530
﻿It's more like
﻿"Pow! Bang! Boom!"

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:01.100
﻿Reiji, how is she going
﻿to understand that?

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:04.010
﻿Control skills are my department.
﻿I'll do it my way!

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.850
﻿P-Please don't fight.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.840
﻿Kousaka, keep an eye
﻿on your opponent!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:16.770
﻿Okay.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.140
﻿Here I go!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.770
﻿Okay.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.740
﻿You should win tomorrow's match
﻿if you can move like this.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.170
﻿Thanks! Reiji and Iori.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.110
﻿Sei, it's already dark.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.780
﻿- Walk her home.
﻿- Okay, I got it.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.150
﻿I'll go cheer you on
﻿tomorrow with Reiji.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:04.190
﻿Thanks.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.990
﻿Can I ask you one thing?

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.330
﻿Yes?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.990
﻿Why did you decide to
﻿play Gunpla Battle?

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.830
﻿It seemed like you hated it at first.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.670
﻿Th-That's because...

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:19.000
﻿No, I was just curious.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:24.980
﻿I got to teach you about Gunpla
﻿and how to control it.

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:27.210
﻿I'm really happy about that.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.280
﻿I got to go back to the basics.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:33.950
﻿I was in a dead end
﻿building my new Gunpla.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:37.750
﻿Wait, you didn't...

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.720
﻿Iori, here is fine.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.530
﻿See you.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.360
﻿Good night.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.440
﻿Good luck, China!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.350
﻿We're rooting for you!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.820
﻿Yeah, thanks.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.250
﻿You're finally here, Miss China.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.890
﻿I commend you for not running away.

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:18.130
﻿Today is the day that I'll defeat you.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.670
﻿Miss Caroline.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.140
﻿Is she the girl that you want
﻿to beat no matter what?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:27.100
﻿Yes.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.810
﻿Don't worry.
﻿Just fight as I taught you,

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.710
﻿and you'll win.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:36.480
﻿We now begin the Gunpla Battle
﻿World Tournament Commemorative...

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.880
﻿Girls-Only Gunpla Battle Tournament.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.450
﻿Introducing the players
﻿for match one...

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:47.160
﻿Miss China Kousaka, first year at
﻿Seiho Academy middle school.

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.790
﻿Her Gunpla is Mr. Beargguy III.

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.730
﻿Miss Alice Imai, second year at
﻿Sakurazaka Senior High School.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:56.530
﻿Her Gunpla is the Noble Gundam Deco.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:01.400
﻿Iori isn't here yet.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.570
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.050
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.820
<i>﻿Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:24.030
﻿Mr. Beargguy III, it might hurt a bit,

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.000
﻿but let's do this together.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:31.070
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.170
﻿China Kousaka, Mr. Beargguy III.
﻿Here I go!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.790
﻿Relax and aim carefully.

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:06.170
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.740
﻿She's pretty good.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.410
﻿She'd better be.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:16.510
﻿She can't lose before I beat her.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.750
﻿Why were you late!?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.280
﻿Sorry!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.950
﻿What if Kousaka's battle is over!?

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:25.490
﻿Don't worry.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:27.690
﻿Her control is pretty good now.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.290
﻿She won't lose to some no-name player.

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:38.970
﻿She hasn't lost yet!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.040
﻿See, just like I told you.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:44.010
﻿What's the situation?

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.880
﻿Elementary stuff!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.820
﻿That girl!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:58.960
﻿However cute it may be,
﻿with that kind of performance,

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:02.560
﻿you can't beat my Knight Gundam!

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:08.130
﻿Sei, what is that
﻿funny-looking Gunpla?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.900
﻿It's an SD Gundam.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:14.570
﻿Those Gunpla are made in two-heads
﻿proportions so they look cute.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:17.510
﻿But that Gunpla is beautifully made.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:24.510
﻿Even if it's the Legend version,

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:26.750
﻿the surface plating is perfect.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.150
﻿And it's painted
﻿without using stickers.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.420
﻿The cape is replaced with real cloth.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:35.260
﻿This isn't the work of someone
﻿who just started building Gunpla.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.760
﻿How on earth...?

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.460
﻿You've seen nothing yet!

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.230
﻿Take a good look, Miss China.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:45.600
﻿This is my elegant,
﻿brave and magnificent...

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.210
﻿true form of the Knight Gundam!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:51.780
﻿I won't lose!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:57.550
﻿Kousaka, you can do it!

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:58.480
﻿Iori.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.150
﻿You can't afford to look away!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.660
- Darn it!
- ﻿Kousaka!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.030
﻿Goodbye, Miss China!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.430
﻿Adieu!

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.170
﻿- What?
﻿- It bounced back?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.150
﻿Whatever trick you played...

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:41.660
﻿Cotton inside a Gunpla?

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.130
﻿Why did that...?!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.330
﻿What are you thinking!?

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:48.800
﻿Well, Mr. Beargguy Ill's back story is...

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:52.300
﻿that a cute teddy bear
﻿one day turned into a robot.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.140
﻿What kind of logic is that!?

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:57.170
﻿That's enough!

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:08.050
﻿I-I can't move!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.490
﻿The cotton is stuck in the parts.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.960
﻿She stopped her move.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.860
﻿I've never seen such a Gunpla.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.330
﻿What is this!?

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.970
﻿I may have put in too much cotton.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:25.800
﻿Move!

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:29.870
﻿Please move, my Knight!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.820
﻿I can't accept...

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.250
﻿I won't accept it!

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:50.090
﻿Such a Gunpla Battle is unacceptable!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:00.400
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:05.880
﻿Amazing, Kousaka!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.780
﻿Good job, China.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.120
﻿Oh man,

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.890
why would you lose
in the final round?

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.390
﻿She couldn't help it.

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:21.960
﻿She didn't have the parts
﻿to fix that damaged arm.

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:25.560
﻿But congrats on
﻿coming in second, Kousaka.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:29.100
﻿It's all thanks to your help,
﻿Iori and Reiji.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.040
﻿Yeah, that's for sure.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.600
﻿Thank you.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.740
﻿No, I should thank you.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.640
﻿When I saw your Mr. Beargguy III,

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:43.210
﻿I realized you can build your Gunpla
﻿with your own inspiration.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:47.980
﻿I was caught up in Gundam's
﻿setting and world view.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.420
﻿Now I realize that.

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:53.560
﻿Seriously, thanks, Kousaka.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.630
﻿Iori...

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.430
﻿I'm going!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:02.630
﻿Wait! Where're you going!?

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.600
﻿Going back to the store!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:07.270
﻿I finally saw it. My own Gunpla!

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:10.240
﻿Wait. Hold on, Sei!

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.450
﻿Hello, Kousaka residence.

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:25.420
<i>﻿China, what's going on!?</i>

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:29.930
<i>﻿Sei is even more into Gunpla building.</i>

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.760
﻿I think that's a good thing.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:32.600
<i>﻿Huh?</i>

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.900
﻿He isn’t troubled anymore.
﻿He's found his way out.

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:37.200
﻿Now he can move forward.

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:39.440
<i>﻿What do you mean?</i>

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.140
﻿I'm sure...

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.410
﻿He's going to build a great Gunpla!

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:22.130
﻿Sei! Sei!

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:24.060
﻿Oh, Mr. Ral.

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:25.800
﻿I finally finished my—

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.500
﻿Sei, Kaiser lost!

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:29.730
﻿What!?

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:32.570
﻿The last World Tournament champion?

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:33.570
﻿Yes.

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:37.370
﻿He was defeated in the
﻿Finnish qualifying tournament.

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.440
﻿H-How could...

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:44.810
﻿His opponent was...

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:53.920
﻿A young girl!

00:23:55.630 --> 00:23:57.500
﻿Reiji, it's finally started!

00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.330
Whoever our opponent, we won't lose.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.400
﻿"Next episode,
﻿The World Tournament Begins".

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:04.900
I feel like I'm dreaming.
